eczos-network-optical (0.1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Disable unconfigured target-level CHAP authentication for the documented
    private-LAN, single-client sharing model.
  * Roll back partially created LIO targets and pSCSI backstores when sharing
    fails, so a retry does not collide with stale configfs objects.
  * Parse Avahi's quoted TXT record list correctly so disconnected shares stay
    discoverable and connected shares retain their managed status.
  * Decode UTF-8 octet escapes in discovered drive labels and capabilities.

 -- EasyComp Zeeland <support@easycompzeeland.nl>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:25:00 +0200

eczos-network-optical (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add LAN discovery, LIO sharing and Open-iSCSI connection management for
    physical optical drives.
  * Enforce a single active initiator with a server-side ACL guard.

